<!--
  Every word the app says, in English.

  A translation is a copy of this file under res/values-<tag>, plus the tag in locales.xml. Anything
  a locale has not translated falls back to the string here, so a half-finished language renders
  correctly rather than blank.

  Chord names and chord symbols are not in here. "Am" is a symbol that has to match the diagrams and
  the tab sites people cross-reference, and its root is a pitch class the app spells itself — see
  NoteNaming for the one spelling that is a preference rather than a language.
-->
